        "question": "What is the main difference between a jaw crusher and a cone crusher?",
        "answer": "A jaw crusher generally uses a moving jaw and fixed jaw for primary crushing, while a cone crusher uses a mantle and concave and is commonly used for secondary, tertiary or further crushing."
